  "description": "Opaque seeded three-colour abstract block collage inspired by modernist textile and editorial geometry. Aligned vertical modules split into irregular stacked rectangles, with intermittent full- or half-width stripe panels that form clean T-junctions and comb-like interruptions. Most stripe panels alternate a colour with black; selected panels alternate blue and pink for additional rhythm. Module Width (percent of shorter side) and Block Height establish the grid; Vertical Breakup adds per-column subdivisions; Stripe Pitch and Weight control the horizontal lines; Striped Blocks controls where they appear. Black Coverage controls base black rectangles, Blue / Pink Balance determines chromatic distribution (0 = pink, 100 = blue), Hue Rotation rotates both accent hues while retaining black, and Seed creates repeatable variations. The effect is fully procedural: ignores source RGB and generates opaque output.",
